WEBVTT

00:00:00.263 --> 00:00:04.054
Everyone who rings up sales, with <b>their own account</b>

00:00:04.128 --> 00:00:05.999
Tap <b>Nuevo cajero</b> (new cashier)

00:00:06.074 --> 00:00:14.029
Their name, their email and a password

00:00:14.158 --> 00:00:16.989
Create it, and they can sign in to check out

00:00:17.058 --> 00:00:25.572
That way every sale shows who rang it up, and the dashboard shows how much each one sold
